/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-14T13:52:18Z","updated_at":"2025-08-14T13:52:18Z","body":"This needs a proposal that explains its use-cases. It somewhat complements the bottom panel lock feature, but it doesn't necessarily make sense for the inspector. Also it should be discussed how the feature should work; putting a button at the bottom of the inspector may not be ideal solution.\r\n\r\n> All additions have been clearly marked in the editor/inspector/editor_inspector.cpp using the following format:\r\n\r\nThis should be removed. We do sometimes denote sections with comments, but not codeblocks.\r\n\r\n> The button changes its icon color to green when locked and white when unlocked.\r\n\r\nIt should use Lock/Unlock icon if anything.\r\n\r\n> (Haven't tried with the mono version yet).\r\n\r\nNo need to, language is irrelevant here.\r\n\r\n> For the demo video of the feature, check this out: https://youtu.be/NV9M_Ofev1A\r\n\r\nYou can attach the video directly in the message.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI gave it some testing, and the top of the inspector is not being locked:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/faf094f4-fd74-408f-b11d-e5890aeda229\r\n\r\nAnd especially the filter field becomes disabled when you deselect node.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3188539669/reac